      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Diaphragmatic crus lipoma is a rare entity and it occasionally occurs bilaterally. In this case, a patient with bilateral and symmetric shape diaphragmatic lipomas that were demonstrated during routine thoraco-abdominal CT examination is presented."},
